>>>
>>>>> (as 'lib' is unspecified)
>>>
>>>>>
>>>
>>>>>> library("GLAD")
>>>
>>>>> Error in library("GLAD") : there is no package called 'GLAD'
>>>
>>>>>
>>>
>>>>> That should do it.  Let me know if it works for you.
>>>
>>>>>
